### Get all students
GET http://localhost:8081/api/students

### Create new student
POST http://localhost:8081/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Lê Văn C",
  "email": "c@fpt.edu.vn",
  "age": 22
}

### Update student
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn A Updated",
  "email": "a.updated@fpt.edu.vn",
  "age": 22
}
